OL,3,CEddie Howe leaves Newcastle United
OL,5,FEddie Howe has left Newcastle United,
OL,6,Faccording to reports.
OL,8,FHe has been the club's head coach
OL,9,Fsince 2021.
OL,11,FHowe, 48, led the Magpies to their
OL,12,Ffirst major silverware in 70 years,
OL,13,Fwith the club lifting the Carabao Cup
OL,14,Fat Wembley last year.
OL,16,FHaving joined shortly after the Saudi-
OL,17,Fled takeover with Newcastle
OL,18,Flanguishing in the relegation zone, he
OL,19,Fhelped the team to two Champions
OL,20,FLeague competitions across nearly five
OL,21,Fyears in charge.
