OL,3,CEddie Howe leaves Newcastle United
OL,5,FIt follows a disappointing campaign
OL,6,Flast season, in which they could only
OL,7,Ffinish 12th and failed to secure
OL,8,FEuropean football.
OL,10,FNewcastle have endured a difficult
OL,11,Ftransfer window this summer with the
OL,12,Fdeparture of key players and a tough
OL,13,Fstart to pre-season, with a draw
OL,14,Fagainst Gateshead and defeat to
OL,15,FBristol City.
OL,17,FThis is a breaking story with more
OL,18,Fdetails to follow...
